<http://data.silknow.org/object/8c315f1a-1488-3ce4-b092-4eebcf63d409>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: cotton and linen, five pieces sewn together.  Design: scalloped lower edge embroidered with scrolling bands containing flowers; scallops divide valance into nine compartments of which five to left are filled with colorful birds perched on branches (3d one is empty); three to right are filled with delicate scrolling branches bearing fruit and flowers.  Worked with polychrome wools in chain stitch with a few details in French knots.  Some holes and mends, black yarns rotted out."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/02130ec0-2451-391c-9b0e-d3b2ce991cdd> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Ground: cotton and linen, five pieces sewn together.  Design: scalloped lower edge embroidered with scrolling bands containing flowers; scallops divide valance into nine compartments of which five to left are filled with colorful birds perched on branches (3d one is empty); three to right are filled with delicate scrolling branches bearing fruit and flowers.  Worked with polychrome wools in chain stitch with a few details in French knots.  Some holes and mends, black yarns rotted out."@en ;
